{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_integration_serve_api_serve_api", "label": "Serve API", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/integration/serve-api.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Public and unauthenticated by design - called from browsers, where a credential could not be kept secret anyway; the management API is a separate authenticated surface. Every endpoint answers from the active deployment of the resolved environment. Endpoints come in id, projectId+slug, and Referer-resolved flavours."}, {"id": "docs_integration_serve_api_serve_all_endpoint", "label": "/serve/all endpoint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/integration/serve-api.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Returns the whole environment in one call - microfrontends with resolved URLs and versions plus variables. nameToIntegrate is the Module Federation remote name (slug with / and - stripped). The endpoint to build runtime discovery on."}, {"id": "docs_integration_serve_api_entry_point_no_cache", "label": "Entry point no-cache headers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/integration/serve-api.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The microfrontend entry point is served with Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate while every other file is cacheable. The uncacheable entry point is what makes a deployment take effect promptly: browsers re-fetch it, discover the new hashed chunk names, and load those from cache or network."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_integration_serve_api_serve_api", "target": "docs_environments_domains_allowed_domains", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/integration/serve-api.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "d